2pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt\">2. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt\">수강과목수</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt\"> :</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt\"> 2과목 6학점 이내</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 83.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -83.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">※</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\"> 단, <font color=\"#ff0000\">1학년중 MSC 3과목 수강하여야 하는 학생만</font> 대학수학1, 일반물리학1, 일반화학1 3과목수강가능)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 83.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -83.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\">3. 수업기간</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 83.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -83.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"></p>\n<table style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"1\">\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.7pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.7pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.7pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"99\" height=\"58\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 83.5pt; TEXT-IN