line\">2011. 6. 08(수) ~ 6.10(금), 3일간</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\">8. 수강료 납부기관 : 농협, 우체국 전국지점(가상계좌 납부가능)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\">9. 강좌 개설 조건</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"></p>\n<table style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"1\">\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.7pt dotted; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.6pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.6pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"164\" bgcolor=\"#dcf8f8\" height=\"25\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">강 좌 구 분</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.7pt dotted; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.6pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.7pt dotted; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.6pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"209\" bgcolor=\"#dcf8f8\" height=\"25\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">개 설 최 소 인 원</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.6pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.7pt dotted; PADDING-TOP: 1.4p